// Managed by Ansible (peal-infra). Overrides 50unattended-upgrades.
// The reboot a kernel update needs is peal-reboot's, at
// unattended_reboot_time, which holds it while an md array is degraded:
// unattended-upgrades would hand it to systemd hours ahead, with no hook
// to look at the arrays when the time comes.
Unattended-Upgrade::Remove-Unused-Kernel-Packages "true";
Unattended-Upgrade::Remove-Unused-Dependencies "true";
Unattended-Upgrade::Automatic-Reboot "false";
